Origins
-------
The config parser and the endpoint model started from the author's own work in
Panther VPN (github.com/Amirmahdavi2022/Panther-VPN) and were extended here with
vmess support, re-serialisation, and CDN fronting.

No third-party configuration files are included in this repository. The public
pool lists named in the source are read over the network at runtime, as data,
the same way any subscription client reads them.
